    "innovation": "This paper develops ex-ante climate strategies that incorporate Earth system uncertainty, demonstrating that mitigating risks requires earlier net-zero emissions, a higher near-term carbon price, and sustained long-term carbon capture compared to traditional ex-post approaches.",
